    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of \u2018Dice &amp; Figurines: Business Life Simulator\u2019, a game about running your own business - a shop selling figurines of warriors and monsters.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take on the role of owner and seller, order and sell figurines, sell drinks and snacks,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> Serve customers in a way that makes them happy,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> Hire staff and introduce automation to your shop.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> Provide customers with board game tables using figurines.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> Take your shop to the next levels of development, furnish and equip it with shelves, cash registers and tables.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Grow your business, strive for excellence in customer service and create the most popular place for all figurines game lovers!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Immerse yourself in the world of \u2018Dice &amp; Figurines: Business Life Simulator\u2019, a game about running your own business - a shop selling figurines of warriors and monsters.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Take on the role of owner and seller, order and sell figurines, sell drinks and snacks,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> Serve customers in a way that makes them happy,</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> Hire staff and introduce automation to your shop.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> Provide customers with board game tables using figurines.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> Take your shop to the next levels of development, furnish and equip it with shelves, cash registers and tables.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Grow your business, strive for excellence in customer service and create the most popular place for all figurines game lovers!</strong></i></p>",
